hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23876","Hasan narrated to us, Ibn Lahi'ah narrated to us, Yazid ibn Amr al-Ma'afiri narrated to us from a man of Banu Ghifar that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever does not shave his pubes, trim his nails and clip his mustache is not of us."
